[] There IS a way to win !

there are many ways to win! nethack is very circumstantial and you
have to learn how to take advantage of oppurtunities as they arise.
keep in mind that many have mastered the game using little more than
common sense. you won't get far by expecting the game to please your
habits but if you meticulously follow the game you'll notice subtle
habits that it has that you can exploit.

a rule of thumb that i like to follow on the starting levels ( < 5 )
is to keep my exp level greater than twice the current dungeon level.
this is perhaps indicative of the slow pace of this game. your mileage
may vary.

[] Who has done it ?  How long does it take ?

many have won (you'll hear about it)!

let's just say that it takes a few days to reach the castle
(assuming you don't notice Medusa first) and then you've still got
to go hell and back! you may die a thousand deaths before you get
it right. fare thee well ...

